OL,3,GNEWSAHow a stolen 1957 wedding album
OL,4,Afound its way home
OL,5,
OL,6,FDumped behind a city centre cafe, a
OL,7,Fweathered wedding album dating back to
OL,8,F1957 captured one young couple's
OL,9,Fhappiest day.
OL,11,FBut who they were and how the keepsake
OL,12,Fended up there remained a mystery until
OL,13,Fa family history enthusiast picked up
OL,14,Fthe trail.
OL,16,FInside, pages of black and white
OL,17,Fphotographs featured the smiling
OL,18,Fnewlyweds, surrounded by family and
OL,19,Ffriends. Among the pictures was a
OL,20,Fbarely readable faded list of names.
