OL,3,GNEWSAHow a stolen 1957 wedding album
OL,4,Afound its way home
OL,5,
OL,6,FIt was back in August when the album
OL,7,Fwas found by the owners of Eva's
OL,8,FKitchen in Wakefield. Keen to return it
OL,9,Fto the family it belonged to, they
OL,10,Fcontacted their local newspaper, which
OL,11,Fpublished an appeal.
